  "text": "Repository: https://github.com/Data-Fenix/aws-sagemaker-pipeline. An ML workflow is a sequence of ML tasks that run in order; this project demonstrates a complete end-to-end pipeline on AWS SageMaker Pipelines for a telco customer churn use case. Identifying churning customers saves the telecom company millions. The pipeline covers data ingestion, preprocessing, XGBoost training, evaluation, conditional model registration and deployment. It uses the \"bring your own code\" concept: custom scripts are containerised with Docker and the inference job runs a Flask app. The dataset has 7,043 telco customers with 21 features and a binary Churn target.",
